<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Central Garden started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Central Garden started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had started coverage of Central Garden &amp; Pet Co with a rating of near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the lawn and pet products company closed on Tuesday at 22-1/16.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
